WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
In 1976, a film carried two conflicting clues.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The mouth formed ga.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
But the recorded voice said ba.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Some listeners reported da — a sound not on the soundtrack.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Not everyone experiences the same percept. Responses vary.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Experience is a report. Explaining its cause requires proof.
